            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh",
            "description": "POST /auth/refresh \u2014 200 rotated `{ accessToken, refreshToken }`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me",
            "description": "Returns the authenticated user's profile and live roles.\n\n**Auth:** Bearer token required.\n\n**200** \u2014 Profile returned successfully.\n\n**401** \u2014 Missing or invalid token (`AUTHENTICATION_FAILED`).\n\n**404** \u2014 Token valid but user record no longer exists (`NOT_FOUND`).\n\n**503** \u2014 Database unavailable (`DB_UNAVAILABLE`). Previously caused by an ambiguous PostgREST FK embed on `user_roles \u2192 users`; fixed by disambiguating with `users!user_id!inner(deleted_at)`."
          },
          "response": [
            {
